{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/1075852e7477cfac0b3e48c9c99ec39c.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Discover a dark mystery only a medium can solve. Explore the real world and the spirit world at the same time. Use your psychic abilities to solve puzzles spanning both worlds, uncover deeply disturbing secrets, and survive encounters with The Maw - a monster born from an unspeakable tragedy..<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fea5f2d982180fd1588fac66fa3cbbba.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fea5f2d982180fd1588fac66fa3cbbba.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fea5f2d982180fd1588fac66fa3cbbba.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Medium is a third-person psychological horror game that features patented dual-reality gameplay and an original soundtrack co-composed by Arkadiusz Reikowski and Akira Yamaoka.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/ea540d26c6595df1aef98d4ed7b922aa.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Wield unique psychic abilities reserved for those with the gift. Travel between the realities or explore them both at the very same time. Use the Out of Body experience to investigate places where your real-world self can\u2019t go. Create energy shields and deliver powerful spirit blasts to survive the spirit world and its otherworldly dangers.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fca9c801624ac732f89e890b7ed170b2.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fca9c801624ac732f89e890b7ed170b2.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fca9c801624ac732f89e890b7ed170b2.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/63a242ca98b2d374b32e137817232136.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Delve deep into a mature and morally ambiguous story, where nothing is what it seems and everything has another side. As a medium you see, hear and experience more than others, and with every new perspective you will change your perception on what happened at the Niwa resort.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/45591d9e9e2d4b516d5453e4ceaa9674.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/45591d9e9e2d4b516d5453e4ceaa9674.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/45591d9e9e2d4b516d5453e4ceaa9674.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/9a8c1e8a17176b8248ef2db99262ef7c.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Never-seen-before and officially patented gameplay that plays out across two worlds displayed at the same time. Explore the physical world and the spirit world simultaneously, and use the interactions between them to solve dual-reality puzzles, unlock new paths, and awaken memories of past events.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/6044a06075cdebb97f7ff3a8b0b50256.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/6044a06075cdebb97f7ff3a8b0b50256.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/6044a06075cdebb97f7ff3a8b0b50256.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/db925d1bc082c0aad7f5377629196743.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>The Medium\u2019s spirit world is a dark mirror reflection of our reality, a grim and unsettling place where our unpunished deeds, evil urges, and vile secrets manifest themselves and can take on a form. This world has been invented and designed under the inspiration of Zdzis\u0142aw Beksi\u0144ski\u2019s paintings, Polish dystopian surrealist internationally recognized for his distinctive and strikingly ominous style.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/5343e8b1f59e8e37d6598da76c82a6ae.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/5343e8b1f59e8e37d6598da76c82a6ae.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/5343e8b1f59e8e37d6598da76c82a6ae.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/08b3a1e2886c1d82d97019566008a74d.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in the disturbing and oppressive atmosphere of the game thanks to the original \u2018dual\u2019 soundtrack co-created by Akira Yamaoka and Arkadiusz Reikowski. Yamaoka-san is a legendary Japanese composer best known for his work on the Silent Hill series; Reikowski is a Hollywood Music in Media Awards nominee who worked on such acclaimed horror games as Blair Witch, Layers of Fear, and Observer. Now they join their creative forces for the music and songs of The Medium.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/d8e8027cc3edef1b19ded8817003a8c2.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/d8e8027cc3edef1b19ded8817003a8c2.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/d8e8027cc3edef1b19ded8817003a8c2.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Last Goodbye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/61555df552da4cda058abadfdd59587ca21eed64.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Niwa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/ac93917cca237d76dd22a01c2abda89753cf90c2.jpg"},{"name":"The Cheerful Kind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/fdd0f8e1c8e94708266dc0314f2089ddcba01441.jpg"},{"name":"You Saw, You Ran, You Lived","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/e106f5de1121d60d36a9b34902a4d8a0c38ab143.jpg"},{"name":"The Childeater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/e2319f0912ce94155191315ab4cdff27d186b0e8.jpg"},{"name":"Unforgiven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/aa96764daa868114d072a9018e2d98ab2b6fa1b4.jpg"},{"name":"Among the Ashes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/1e3f881191175ee3de83b4aa64aeec7cceeb3fe4.jpg"},{"name":"The Hound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/4189641efd96312adc9b420a0e50e0449d8cea49.jpg"},{"name":"Unrepentant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/56a11c61cda787b8fb95063614b73a05b0ac4545.jpg"},{"name":"The Pact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1293160/f909b1faddac3349d2a77b0919ad3c05c4e39f47.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1293160?t=1766087918","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766087918","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766087918","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766087918","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work. Frequent violence and gore and general mature content is present.\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>CHECK OUT THE NEW GAME FROM BLOOBER TEAM</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/c68d78a773437863e1175df856b85231.avif?t=1766087918\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p></p><br><h1>THE MEDIUM - DELUX EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/2f845140702c61a77529ef911bcd368f.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/1075852e7477cfac0b3e48c9c99ec39c.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Discover a dark mystery only a medium can solve. Explore the real world and the spirit world at the same time. Use your psychic abilities to solve puzzles spanning both worlds, uncover deeply disturbing secrets, and survive encounters with The Maw - a monster born from an unspeakable tragedy..<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fea5f2d982180fd1588fac66fa3cbbba.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fea5f2d982180fd1588fac66fa3cbbba.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fea5f2d982180fd1588fac66fa3cbbba.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Medium is a third-person psychological horror game that features patented dual-reality gameplay and an original soundtrack co-composed by Arkadiusz Reikowski and Akira Yamaoka.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/ea540d26c6595df1aef98d4ed7b922aa.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Wield unique psychic abilities reserved for those with the gift. Travel between the realities or explore them both at the very same time. Use the Out of Body experience to investigate places where your real-world self can\u2019t go. Create energy shields and deliver powerful spirit blasts to survive the spirit world and its otherworldly dangers.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fca9c801624ac732f89e890b7ed170b2.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fca9c801624ac732f89e890b7ed170b2.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/fca9c801624ac732f89e890b7ed170b2.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/63a242ca98b2d374b32e137817232136.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Delve deep into a mature and morally ambiguous story, where nothing is what it seems and everything has another side. As a medium you see, hear and experience more than others, and with every new perspective you will change your perception on what happened at the Niwa resort.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/45591d9e9e2d4b516d5453e4ceaa9674.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/45591d9e9e2d4b516d5453e4ceaa9674.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/45591d9e9e2d4b516d5453e4ceaa9674.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/9a8c1e8a17176b8248ef2db99262ef7c.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Never-seen-before and officially patented gameplay that plays out across two worlds displayed at the same time. Explore the physical world and the spirit world simultaneously, and use the interactions between them to solve dual-reality puzzles, unlock new paths, and awaken memories of past events.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/6044a06075cdebb97f7ff3a8b0b50256.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/6044a06075cdebb97f7ff3a8b0b50256.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/6044a06075cdebb97f7ff3a8b0b50256.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/db925d1bc082c0aad7f5377629196743.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>The Medium\u2019s spirit world is a dark mirror reflection of our reality, a grim and unsettling place where our unpunished deeds, evil urges, and vile secrets manifest themselves and can take on a form. This world has been invented and designed under the inspiration of Zdzis\u0142aw Beksi\u0144ski\u2019s paintings, Polish dystopian surrealist internationally recognized for his distinctive and strikingly ominous style.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/5343e8b1f59e8e37d6598da76c82a6ae.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/5343e8b1f59e8e37d6598da76c82a6ae.webm?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/5343e8b1f59e8e37d6598da76c82a6ae.mp4?t=1766087918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/08b3a1e2886c1d82d97019566008a74d.webp?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in the disturbing and oppressive atmosphere of the game thanks to the original \u2018dual\u2019 soundtrack co-created by Akira Yamaoka and Arkadiusz Reikowski. Yamaoka-san is a legendary Japanese composer best known for his work on the Silent Hill series; Reikowski is a Hollywood Music in Media Awards nominee who worked on such acclaimed horror games as Blair Witch, Layers of Fear, and Observer. Now they join their creative forces for the music and songs of The Medium.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/d8e8027cc3edef1b19ded8817003a8c2.poster.avif?t=1766087918\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293160/extras/d8e8027cc3edef1b1